{"3216520":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Sandcastle","steam_appid":3216520,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4894830],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandcastle is the ultimate sandbox game. Unlock a variety of tools to gather wet sand, shape towering walls, carve intricate battlements, and engineer elaborate moats designed to withstand or divert the encroaching waves.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/d7dc6bb7dcad73bac5d7b86b941ea2d8.poster.avif?t=1791209243\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/d7dc6bb7dcad73bac5d7b86b941ea2d8.webm?t=1791209243\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/d7dc6bb7dcad73bac5d7b86b941ea2d8.mp4?t=1791209243\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No rush, just relax<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no ticking clocks. Only the slow rhythm of the tide and the warm glow of the sun. Discover secret treasures washed ashore or buried deep into the sand, each adding a touch of personality to your sandy masterpiece.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/9e194cf6848b1ded5c07cc1e1e898703.poster.avif?t=1791209243\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/9e194cf6848b1ded5c07cc1e1e898703.webm?t=1791209243\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/9e194cf6848b1ded5c07cc1e1e898703.mp4?t=1791209243\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics simulation<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the whimsy lies a unique water and sand physics simulation that brings your creations to life. Sand compacts, crumbles, and holds its shape depending on moisture and pressure, while waves flow, pool, and gently erode your walls just as they would in reality. Carve too thin and a tower may slump; reinforce with damp sand and it will stand proud against the tide. The result is a tactile, authentic sand castle crafting experience that feels just like building one on a real beach: sun-warmed, hands-on, and wonderfully satisfying.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/1dc30fabe8a277491e6af06240c88c81.poster.avif?t=1791209243\" width=1170 height=458 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/1dc30fabe8a277491e6af06240c88c81.webm?t=1791209243\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/1dc30fabe8a277491e6af06240c88c81.mp4?t=1791209243\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beach customization<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect starfishes to unlock customization options: Sand type, beach layout, size... Give your beach its own character and charm. Peaceful atolls ringed by turquoise waters, quiet lagoons with gentle shallows, sweeping sand barriers shaped by the breeze, and winding deltas where little streams meet the sea. Every shoreline offers a fresh canvas, inviting you to build, decorate, and relax in a new seaside setting.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/2eab48898f5f172a40ffea7012ad9050.poster.avif?t=1791209243\" width=1170 height=462 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/2eab48898f5f172a40ffea7012ad9050.webm?t=1791209243\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/2eab48898f5f172a40ffea7012ad9050.mp4?t=1791209243\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beaches with unique water and sand physic simulation<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many tools to craft your castle with precision<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different beach layouts to unlock (lagoon, island, sand barrier, delta...)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful and relaxing tropical sceneries<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many hidden objects to find and collect<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/40ec44464a89f97ffa6ae771785be68d.poster.avif?t=1791209243\" width=1170 height=464 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/40ec44464a89f97ffa6ae771785be68d.webm?t=1791209243\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/40ec44464a89f97ffa6ae771785be68d.mp4?t=1791209243\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandcastle is the ultimate sandbox game. Unlock a variety of tools to gather wet sand, shape towering walls, carve intricate battlements, and engineer elaborate moats designed to withstand or divert the encroaching waves.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/d7dc6bb7dcad73bac5d7b86b941ea2d8.poster.avif?t=1791209243\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/d7dc6bb7dcad73bac5d7b86b941ea2d8.webm?t=1791209243\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/d7dc6bb7dcad73bac5d7b86b941ea2d8.mp4?t=1791209243\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No rush, just relax<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no ticking clocks. Only the slow rhythm of the tide and the warm glow of the sun. Discover secret treasures washed ashore or buried deep into the sand, each adding a touch of personality to your sandy masterpiece.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/9e194cf6848b1ded5c07cc1e1e898703.poster.avif?t=1791209243\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/9e194cf6848b1ded5c07cc1e1e898703.webm?t=1791209243\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/9e194cf6848b1ded5c07cc1e1e898703.mp4?t=1791209243\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics simulation<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the whimsy lies a unique water and sand physics simulation that brings your creations to life. Sand compacts, crumbles, and holds its shape depending on moisture and pressure, while waves flow, pool, and gently erode your walls just as they would in reality. Carve too thin and a tower may slump; reinforce with damp sand and it will stand proud against the tide. The result is a tactile, authentic sand castle crafting experience that feels just like building one on a real beach: sun-warmed, hands-on, and wonderfully satisfying.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/1dc30fabe8a277491e6af06240c88c81.poster.avif?t=1791209243\" width=1170 height=458 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/1dc30fabe8a277491e6af06240c88c81.webm?t=1791209243\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/1dc30fabe8a277491e6af06240c88c81.mp4?t=1791209243\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beach customization<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect starfishes to unlock customization options: Sand type, beach layout, size... Give your beach its own character and charm. Peaceful atolls ringed by turquoise waters, quiet lagoons with gentle shallows, sweeping sand barriers shaped by the breeze, and winding deltas where little streams meet the sea. Every shoreline offers a fresh canvas, inviting you to build, decorate, and relax in a new seaside setting.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/2eab48898f5f172a40ffea7012ad9050.poster.avif?t=1791209243\" width=1170 height=462 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/2eab48898f5f172a40ffea7012ad9050.webm?t=1791209243\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/2eab48898f5f172a40ffea7012ad9050.mp4?t=1791209243\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beaches with unique water and sand physic simulation<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many tools to craft your castle with precision<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different beach layouts to unlock (lagoon, island, sand barrier, delta...)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful and relaxing tropical sceneries<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many hidden objects to find and collect<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/40ec44464a89f97ffa6ae771785be68d.poster.avif?t=1791209243\" width=1170 height=464 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/40ec44464a89f97ffa6ae771785be68d.webm?t=1791209243\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/extras\/40ec44464a89f97ffa6ae771785be68d.mp4?t=1791209243\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"On a sun-warmed tropical shore, quietly craft a mighty sandcastle. Carve moats, raise towers and walls, then embellish with driftwood, pebbles, shells and seaweed. Gentle tides, soft surf and a calming color palette turn every build into a peaceful, relaxing moment.","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Italian, Spanish - Latin America","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/32a096d34be1472a135bf1cf2dfd60d1660f8f4a\/header.jpg?t=1791209243","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/f79efaa7df72512532f4cb89c976a7cefd5ed172\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1791209243","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3216520\/f79efaa7df72512532f4cb89c976a7cefd5ed172\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1791209243","website":"https:\/\/sandcastlegame.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10+ 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5 \/ AMD Ryzen<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 3 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 950 \/ AMD Radeon RX 560<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 400 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 14+<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 3 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Apple integrated GPU (M1)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 400 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Ubuntu 20.04+<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5 \/ AMD Ryzen<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 3 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 950 \/ AMD Radeon RX 560<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 400 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":"Copyright Bubblebird Studio"}}}